            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Akhenaten</strong><br>\nAkhenaten, known before the fifth year of his reign as Amenhotep IV, was a pharaoh of the Eighteenth Dynasty of Egypt. He is especially noted for abandoning traditional Egyptian polytheism and introducing worship centered on the Aten, which is often considered monotheism. Akhenaten's reign was a time of significant religious upheaval, and he remains one of Egypt's most controversial and studied pharaohs due to his unique approach to Egyptian religion and art.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Akhenaten's Religious Reforms</strong><br>\nAround the fifth year of his reign, Akhenaten initiated his revolutionary religious reforms. He elevated the Aten, the sun disk, to the status of the supreme god and diminished the role of the traditional state god Amun. This shift disrupted centuries of Egyptian religious tradition. His new religion promised a more personal relationship with the deity, with Akhenaten as the sole intermediary between the Aten and the people.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Akhetaten: The Horizon of the Aten</strong><br>\nTo complement his religious reforms, Akhenaten established a new capital city called Akhetaten, known today as Amarna. This city was dedicated to the Aten and served as the center for the Aten's worship. The art and architecture of Amarna were markedly different from the rest of Egypt, reflecting the innovative spirit of Akhenaten's reign and his religious convictions.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
